    <string name="settings.miniplayer.title">Minimal mode (Picture-in-Picture)</string>
    <string name="settings.miniplayer.desc">When enabled, minimizing the main window shows a small always-on-top player with the song cover, play/pause, next/previous and a seekable timeline. Clicking the cover brings the main window back.</string>
    <string name="settings.closetotray.title">Tray icon on close</string>
    <string name="settings.closetotray.desc">When enabled, closing the window with the X (or Alt+F4) does not quit RiPlay: it stays in the notification area and keeps playing; double-click the icon to reopen the window, use \"Quit RiPlay\" in its menu to exit for real. When disabled (default), the X closes the app.</string>
    <string name="settings.karaoke.title">Karaoke overlay</string>
    <string name="settings.karaoke.desc">When enabled, a small always-on-top window shows the current lyrics line (and the next one) synced with playback. Drag it anywhere, the position is remembered; it needs synced lyrics (LRCLIB/KuGou), otherwise it shows the song title and artist.</string>
